      86.59,
      487.38,
      539.9,
      521.71
    ],
    "text": "01.In view of letter dated 25.09.2002 issued by the Personnel Manager, Sri Lanka Transport Board to Mr. P. A. A. Gunatilakewho was recruited to the service of the said Board with effect from 2nd July 1970. What date should be cosidered as thedate of first appointment of him?",
