  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      86.59,
      560.58,
      539.93,
      582.79
    ],
    "text": "03.Whether any unjust was caused to Mr. P. A. A. Gunatilake due to retiring him at the age of 55 years effective from28.12. 2005? if any unjust was caused, to what relief is entitled, and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
