  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      86.59,
      597.18,
      539.9,
      619.51
    ],
    "text": "04.Whether Mr. P. A. A. Gunatilake is entitled to receive arrears of salary in terms of the Circular No. 02 of 2004 issued bythe Finance Division of the Sri Lanka Transport Board. If so, what should be the quantum in arrears payable to him.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
